  "component": "HottyTree",
  "icon": "account_tree",
  "description": "This repository's files, 204 of them. The arrows, j and k move the selection, which is written to /selected; the right arrow and l open a folder, then go into it, the left arrow and h close it, then go up; what is open is written to /expanded. A click selects a node and opens or closes a folder. Expand all and Collapse all call hottyExpandAll and hottyCollapseAll. Typing in Filter shows the files whose names hold its characters, in order, with the folders they're in, every folder open. Enter, or a second click on the selected file, sends openFile with it; Enter on a folder opens or closes it.",
